          "settings": {
            "title": "Composition and care",
            "content": "<p>80% polyamide<br/>20% elastane<br/><br/>To preserve the quality and duration of use of fitness clothing made of fabric, we recommend following the following tips:<br/><br/>1. Washing: We recommend washing in a delicate mode in cold water.<br/><br/>2. Drying: Air dry, avoid direct sunlight.<br/><br/>3. Dry in the washing machine: Avoid high spins.<br/><br/>4. Ironing: Iron carefully at a low temperature.<br/><br/>Following these tips will help preserve the excellent condition and longevity of your clothing.</p>",
            "page": "wash-care"
