        "754ad4a0-7308-4a3e-b325-e2f2c0b85d4c": {
          "type": "tab_html",
          "settings": {
            "title": "About our clothes",
            "content": "<p>Our sportswear set is the perfect combination of style, comfort, and functionality. Made from premium-quality materials, it provides maximum comfort even during the most intense workouts. The fabric consists of 75% polyester, ensuring durability, wear resistance, and easy care, and 15% spandex, offering elasticity and a perfect fit.</p><p>The material is highly breathable, allowing your skin to “breathe” even during high-intensity activities. You’ll feel comfortable in any temperature or condition. The fabric efficiently wicks away moisture, keeping you dry and fresh throughout the day.</p><p>This sportswear is not only practical but also exceptionally reliable, making it the perfect choice for those who value quality and longevity. Its modern design highlights your figure, boosting confidence with every move. Suitable for both sports and everyday wear, it adds a stylish touch to your look.</p><p>Experience the ultimate in quality and design — this sportswear set will become your favorite companion for any activit!</p>",
            "page": "wash-care"
          }
        },
